# Accepted risks for `trivy config`. Each entry needs a reason; review them regularly.

# AWS-0040 — EKS public API endpoint (terraform-aws-modules/eks).
# Needed so kubectl works from an admin laptop. Access is limited to
# var.cluster_endpoint_public_access_cidrs, and a validation rule rejects 0.0.0.0/0.
AWS-0040

# AWS-0104 — EKS node security group allows all egress (terraform-aws-modules/eks).
# Worker nodes in private subnets must reach container registries and AWS APIs through
# the NAT gateway; inbound traffic stays restricted.
AWS-0104
